{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2022-02-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'CALLING YOUNG INNOVATORS: T-MOBILE AND THE T-MOBILE FOUNDATION LAUNCH FOURTH CHANGEMAKER CHALLENGE TO FUND BIG IDEAS', 'text': 'BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY T-MOBILE, THE T-MOBILE FOUNDATION AND ASHOKA KICKED OFF THE FOURTH CHANGEMAKER CHALLENGE, A NATIONWIDE CONTEST THAT GIVES YOUNG LEADERS THE OPPORTUNITY TO LEVEL UP THEIR IDEAS FOR CREATING A MORE INCLUSIVE, EQUITABLE AND SUSTAINABLE FUTURE. NOW THROUGH MARCH 31, 2022, TEENS AGES 13 TO 18 LOCATED IN THE U.S. AND PUERTO RICO WITH BOLD IDEAS FOR DRIVING DIGITAL EMPOWERMENT, PUTTING EQUITY INTO ACTION AND MOBILIZING FOR A THRIVING PLANET CAN ENTER THE CHANGEM'}